   589                           ;	MCLRE = ON, RA5/MCLR/VPP pin function is MCLR
   590                           ;	Brown-out Detect Enable bit
   591                           ;	BOREN = ON, BOD enabled
   592                           ;	Low-Voltage Programming Enable bit
   593                           ;	LVP = OFF, RB4/PGM pin has digital I/O function, HV on MCLR must be used for programmi
      +                          ng
   594                           ;	Data EE Memory Code Protection bit
   595                           ;	CPD = OFF, Data memory code protection off
   596                           ;	Flash Program Memory Code Protection bit
   597                           ;	CP = OFF, Code protection off
